  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Atlas — Next.js 15 live geospatial fleet-tracking control room. A MapLibre map where a server-authoritative simulated fleet glides smoothly in real time over a keyless Protomaps basemap, with route trails, live ETAs, and geofence events.",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev -p 3093",
